cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Tashwish: Gulf GNSS Interference Observatory"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mueen"
    given-names: "Huda"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hudasol/tashwish"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Open pipeline and dashboard that derives aggregate maps and time series of GNSS jamming-like and spoofing-like
  anomalies over the Gulf from public ADS-B data (adsb.lol, ODbL). Research and monitoring tool; not for navigation
  or safety of life; makes no attribution to any actor.
keywords:
  - GNSS
  - jamming
  - spoofing
  - ADS-B
  - open data
